{"generated": "2026-11-25 03:18", "brief": "<b>1. 다올투자증권 경영권 M&amp;A 추진</b>\n이병철 회장이 지분 매각을 추진하면서 다올투자증권이 M&amp;A 매물로 수면 위로 올라왔습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQY1BNd29zRmZUVk16WlQ1OGl0TVVCNkFZRWJwTU43ZEp1UWxNaE9JdWhhemwxdEpWZUprOFpKRzBOSnFGNWhRYkpJSlpxdDJRQ094UTBja1libFNJV1dSV3NZT3JlcU5DRjV4RVlNdFRZUVcyVTdNZ0pJeG9rTDZKSjZYcWVXVEN3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5Kb1hFZ2dGSFNmQXFqLW5MVmJ0YXptTEhyeWxNUjdIa01DLW1GQVFTdTRiRmhkZ0dFNGZqSGNXUFJ4akkwaDJEWTB4VUxoR3pWb1UwRDc0enBjQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>]. 증권가에서는 이번 경영권 매각 향방과 향후 금융권 지배구조 재편에 주목하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQY1BNd29zRmZUVk16WlQ1OGl0TVVCNkFZRWJwTU43ZEp1UWxNaE9JdWhhemwxdEpWZUprOFpKRzBOSnFGNWhRYkpJSlpxdDJRQ094UTBja1libFNJV1dSV3NZT3JlcU5DRjV4RVlNdFRZUVcyVTdNZ0pJeG9rTDZKSjZYcWVXVEN3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a>].\n\n<b>2. 앤스로픽 IPO 후 주가 하락 및 고평가 논란</b>\n글로벌 초대형 테크 IPO로 주목받은 앤스로픽이 상장 나흘 만에 공모가($83)를 하회하며 고평가 및 경쟁 심화 우려에 직면했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1xVnJmWWN5NFJoeDlfdWhFNzZMTjJTMU9KdWVrUDl3aXdGTkdTN0x6bEl3Wm1zVjBrMTJIb2JkZTNsWE56U2JxWDNXeVVDaXNHRTJWVnlZRE83VVg1?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5aVmJOT0RjMkRQYk5pMHRyZ2JzTmVvRjFCY1paYzRaR0JLWXhaNkJXOHBSMGdnbV9jTUlBNXJaaDRBUVhhelExVzN0c2h0c0xrZVBkMENIRDBOdkg2MFdYMnFRTEo4elpZRmd1a2FYSHpXY0k?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#37</a>]. 창업자 남매의 7,500억 원 규모 주식 매각과 기술주 매도세가 맞물렸으나, 월가 일각에서는 여전히 장기 성장성에 기반한 매수 의견을 유지하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVHBLdEJ2WG9kVnktMGQ5b240REpvZVdJdVdjVDRZY0NrRFp0ajF4azBBTVZCcGZZa0JLdHljaTd5VUpJNjVKYU1kUnhHTGFZeVpOOUsyMU9aTFNiZEFVaVoyRFozRjA1OGVvWVFFeFRZM0JkLS1jWlQ1UmpqTkc1d0ZmcGptZElN?oc=5\" target=\"_bl